WEBVTT

00:00:00.585 --> 00:00:05.455
Yume kara samete mo
Even if I wake from my dreams

00:00:06.495 --> 00:00:11.835
Kono te wo nobasu yo
I'll reach my hand out to you

00:00:23.475 --> 00:00:28.745
Onaji tsuyosa de yobi au
If our hearts can reach each other

00:00:29.485 --> 00:00:34.185
Kokoro ni nareru no naraba
with the same strength

00:00:35.425 --> 00:00:40.695
Nanninbun no kizu demo
Then I would be able to bare

00:00:41.225 --> 00:00:46.365
Boku wa uketome rareru yo
The pain of many hearts

00:00:46.765 --> 00:00:50.295
Mousukoshi datte kiga surun da
I can feel that it will arrive soon

00:00:50.375 --> 00:00:55.305
Kono kabe ga kuzureru
When these walls will be torn down

00:00:56.115 --> 00:01:00.445
Reimei
The dawn

00:01:02.185 --> 00:01:08.145
Yume kara samete mo
mada minai yume no houmade
Even if we wake from our dreams
We'll have to keep running

00:01:08.225 --> 00:01:14.125
Bokura wa hitori de
hashiri tsuzukeru shika nain da
Towards our unrevealed dreams

00:01:14.195 --> 00:01:20.755
Korogari mayotte tsukuri dasu
boku no inryoku ga
The gravity by my painful journey
will draw me

00:01:21.035 --> 00:01:26.975
Itsuka kimi e
To you one day

00:01:57.975 --> 00:01:59.905
Even though we've disbanded...

00:02:00.575 --> 00:02:02.605
...there aren't any rumors going around.

00:02:03.315 --> 00:02:05.975
It doesn't have anything
to do with anyone...

00:02:06.045 --> 00:02:07.915
...so it's become uninteresting.

00:02:10.155 --> 00:02:11.145
I get it.

00:02:14.525 --> 00:02:17.655
Have you heard from Ovan?

00:02:19.965 --> 00:02:22.585
His cell phone isn't even working anymore.

00:02:23.595 --> 00:02:24.695
I see.

00:02:32.445 --> 00:02:35.635
Can I ask you, too?

00:02:37.375 --> 00:02:38.365
Ask me what?

00:02:39.185 --> 00:02:40.705
For your phone number.

00:02:42.285 --> 00:02:45.215
I have a feeling you might disappear too.

00:02:46.425 --> 00:02:47.945
I won't disappear.

00:02:49.255 --> 00:02:50.985
Maybe I'm worrying too much.

00:02:56.995 --> 00:02:58.435
Do you have something to write on?

00:02:59.605 --> 00:03:00.825
I'll give you my number.

00:03:01.505 --> 00:03:03.195
If something happens...

00:03:03.635 --> 00:03:05.975
No, even if nothing happens...

00:03:06.345 --> 00:03:08.935
...you can feel free to call me.

00:03:09.615 --> 00:03:10.575
Okay.

00:03:11.475 --> 00:03:13.745
I'll give you mine, too.

00:03:18.385 --> 00:03:20.015
You want to do something?

00:03:20.085 --> 00:03:20.745
Rengeki...

00:03:20.825 --> 00:03:22.185
Not again.

00:03:22.495 --> 00:03:23.585
You're right.

00:03:25.495 --> 00:03:28.755
It doesn't feel like we've
been disbanded, does it?

00:03:28.895 --> 00:03:29.695
Huh?

00:03:29.765 --> 00:03:34.465
I feel like we could go back home
and Shino would still be there.

00:03:35.605 --> 00:03:37.075
You know what?

00:03:37.235 --> 00:03:38.105
What?

00:03:38.205 --> 00:03:40.905
You talk about going back home...

00:03:40.975 --> 00:03:43.305
...but it's all gone,
now that we've disbanded.

00:03:43.445 --> 00:03:44.415
I guess so.

00:03:45.045 --> 00:03:47.875
She's probably in the field or in town...

00:03:48.215 --> 00:03:50.645
...waiting for Ovan.

00:03:53.555 --> 00:03:56.285
When the Twilight Brigade was around...

00:03:56.355 --> 00:03:58.555
...every day was so much fun.

00:04:00.665 --> 00:04:01.625
Hey, Teacher!

00:04:01.995 --> 00:04:03.965
Let's make one!

00:04:04.395 --> 00:04:05.295
Make what?

00:04:05.435 --> 00:04:06.405
A guild!

00:04:06.505 --> 00:04:07.465
A guild?

00:04:08.005 --> 00:04:09.905
Come on! Let's go!

00:04:10.975 --> 00:04:12.705
To apply for a guild.

00:04:14.905 --> 00:04:17.175
What should we call it?

00:04:20.215 --> 00:04:21.945
You're alone again today?

00:04:22.885 --> 00:04:25.115
She was just with me...

00:04:25.185 --> 00:04:28.085
...but had to log out because
she had to write a paper for school.

00:04:28.185 --> 00:04:29.215
I see.

00:04:29.895 --> 00:04:31.985
Don't you have one, too?

00:04:32.125 --> 00:04:33.115
What?

00:04:33.265 --> 00:04:34.525
A term paper.

00:04:34.665 --> 00:04:36.655
I don't feel like it.

00:04:37.435 --> 00:04:39.595
It doesn't matter how you feel.

00:04:39.965 --> 00:04:42.335
You have to do what you've got to do.

00:04:43.035 --> 00:04:45.765
I won't feel right until Ovan gets back.

00:04:46.475 --> 00:04:51.005
Just because Shino logged out,
it doesn't mean I should too.

00:04:57.755 --> 00:05:02.625
What exactly was that thing
we were searching for?

00:05:02.695 --> 00:05:05.655
You asked the same question before.

00:05:06.595 --> 00:05:07.655
I remember.

00:05:08.295 --> 00:05:10.165
So, in the end...

00:05:10.365 --> 00:05:14.925
...it turned out that the
Key of the Twilight doesn't exist.

00:05:15.235 --> 00:05:15.795
But...

00:05:15.875 --> 00:05:16.635
Huh?

00:05:16.705 --> 00:05:20.505
You think Ovan would search for
something that doesn't exist?

00:05:21.105 --> 00:05:22.635
What do you mean?

00:05:23.015 --> 00:05:26.035
He totally believed it existed.

00:05:26.485 --> 00:05:30.435
Is it troubling how that eccentric man
believed in something that doesn't exist?

00:05:30.685 --> 00:05:32.375
It's just not like him.

00:05:32.785 --> 00:05:33.985
Don't you think?

00:05:36.155 --> 00:05:37.885
I wonder.

00:05:47.105 --> 00:05:50.125
We still can't trace Ovan's tracks.

00:05:50.635 --> 00:05:52.575
The search must continue.

00:05:52.705 --> 00:05:56.405
And the analysis of the existing data
must be done quickly.

00:05:57.145 --> 00:05:58.375
Understood.

00:06:16.735 --> 00:06:19.525
Teacher's sure taking a long time.

00:06:22.505 --> 00:06:23.475
Hey!

00:06:24.375 --> 00:06:25.705
It's you.

00:06:25.945 --> 00:06:27.375
You're still here?

00:06:28.805 --> 00:06:30.605
Everyone's already switched.

00:06:30.975 --> 00:06:32.415
You should come, too.

00:06:32.745 --> 00:06:33.875
I know.

00:06:34.415 --> 00:06:35.605
As long as you know.

00:06:35.685 --> 00:06:39.585
Well, I'm getting my stuff ready
and canceling my contract.

00:06:39.655 --> 00:06:40.445
Right.

00:06:40.825 --> 00:06:42.815
I'll be waiting for you over there.

00:06:55.665 --> 00:06:57.295
Oh, wait a second!

00:06:58.505 --> 00:07:03.105
A far away memory

00:07:03.615 --> 00:07:05.815
Is painted on the water's surface

00:07:05.815 --> 00:07:06.945
Is painted on the water's surface
