00:08:29.765 --> 00:08:32.495
I think I'm going to quit.

00:08:32.605 --> 00:08:34.835
What? Why, all of a sudden?

00:08:35.975 --> 00:08:38.565
I have too many memories of the Brigade.

00:08:38.635 --> 00:08:40.905
I can't have fun in this game anymore.

00:08:42.075 --> 00:08:43.335
But...

00:08:44.675 --> 00:08:47.575
My friends in the real world are inviting me.

00:08:48.845 --> 00:08:50.815
Have you heard of "Riot Gun"?

00:08:51.515 --> 00:08:52.485
No.

00:08:53.355 --> 00:08:55.155
I'm switching to that game.

00:08:55.625 --> 00:08:58.455
Even though we just made a guild?

00:08:58.955 --> 00:08:59.925
I'm sorry.

00:09:00.725 --> 00:09:03.855
I thought I could forget
about the Brigade...

00:09:03.935 --> 00:09:04.925
...but I can't.

00:09:05.535 --> 00:09:06.595
