00:09:17.175 --> 00:09:18.975
Thought so.

00:09:21.485 --> 00:09:22.675
Well...

00:09:22.755 --> 00:09:23.685
...take care!

00:09:29.555 --> 00:09:32.755
We've been here together before, haven't we?

00:09:33.195 --> 00:09:35.355
Yeah, that's right.

00:09:36.335 --> 00:09:42.595
Remember when I said that
we had become alike?

00:09:43.005 --> 00:09:43.565
