00:09:47.375 --> 00:09:49.175
Did you say that?

00:09:50.845 --> 00:09:52.035
That was a lie.

00:09:52.315 --> 00:09:53.285
A lie?

00:09:54.345 --> 00:09:57.845
The truth is I admired him.

00:09:57.915 --> 00:10:00.815
Don't you think it's wonderful
that he was able to...

00:10:00.885 --> 00:10:03.115
...make a home for people?

00:10:08.465 --> 00:10:14.735
I think I wanted to become someone
who could do that for people, too.

00:10:15.205 --> 00:10:16.325
You are.

00:10:19.275 --> 00:10:21.335
