00:10:58.415 --> 00:11:00.935
Even here, I'm all alone.

00:11:18.895 --> 00:11:21.565
You've been facing a lot of troubles lately.

00:11:21.635 --> 00:11:25.265
Don't use convenient words like "a lot".

00:11:25.775 --> 00:11:27.405
You're right.

00:11:27.645 --> 00:11:30.305
